flowchart LR
  M[Merchant in Shopify Admin] -->|Embedded App Home| A[Hosted App UI]
  A -->|init/load/save| T[Topol Editor]
  A -->|Shopify App Bridge / authenticated routes| B[App Backend]
  T -->|CORS + app auth header| B
  B --> DB[(Tenant DB\nshops, templates, campaigns, runs)]
  B --> S[(Object Storage\nimages, previews, HTML snapshots)]
  B --> G[Shopify GraphQL Admin API]
  B --> R[Topol JSON to HTML API\nserver-side secret]
  B --> Q[Queue / Worker]
  Q --> P[Email Provider\nSMTP or ESP API]
  P -->|events| WH[Provider Webhooks]
  WH --> B
  G -->|Flow Action runtime\nHMAC POST| F[Flow Action Endpoint]
  F --> Q
  B -->|external activity + engagement metrics| G
  G --> SEG[Shopify Customer Segments]
